notes.content:
[h2]Heavenly Acres Demo has just launched![/h2]
Now you can try it risk-free!

[b]Demo limitations include:[/b]
- Only have access to 4 overworld maps (full version has 20+);
- 20 crops maximum (full version is unlimited);
- 5 buildings maximum (full version is unlimited);
- 6 monsters owned maximum (full version is 200);
- 20 crops at a time maximum (full version is unlimited);
- Cannot go past friendship status with misfits (full version includes marriage);
- Demo ends at the end of Day 5 Summer (full version is unlimited);
- Access to one dungeon and two caves (full version has 9 dungeons and 10 caves)
- 10% of the story
- Castle is not in the demo
- Access to one festival
- Limited access to all the characters due to only having 4 overworld maps

This demo will give you the feel of all the mechanics to see how they run before pulling the trigger!
I felt like this was the MOST important part of the game for most people.
To see how it feels, runs, and the basics of the game.

The content that lays in the game is built upon those mechanics!

Thank you for the interest and as always if you have questions, concerns, or whatever slap me upside the face to get my attention! I don't bite!

- Stapleton
